The legal text is the Constitution of the Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan with its amendments to 31 January 2022, as
published by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Jordan (https://www.mfa.gov.jo), retrieved 29 October 2026. The site
states no licence. Its robots.txt content signal allows use as a reference (use=reference) and forbids AI training;
this repository is a reference copy and is not used to train models.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text was converted to one Markdown file per article; footnote lines and their markers,
page numbers and layout control characters were removed; line breaks within a clause were joined. The wording of the
law was not changed. The Government of Jordan does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages and the tools) are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
